  "summary": "Beethoven was baptized in Bonn on 17 December 1770. In November 1792 he went to Vienna to study with Haydn, and after the 1794 French occupation of the Rhineland the trip became a permanent move. He died in the Schwarzspanierhaus in Vienna on 26 March 1827.",
